      "message": "[warning] Line 231: 🟡 `dispatchPush()` offloads `mNotificationService.processPush()` to `Schedulers.io()` with no ordering/serialization guarantee. Under bursty pushes, processing may run concurrently and reorder relative to other queued push work, weakening the ‘restore/reconnect before delivery’ intent. Route push processing through the same serialized execution path (main-handler block or daemon executor) to preserve deterministic ordering.",
